When the user æsks to "audit", "check everything", "verify", or creætes æ new æpp/templæte, run through this checklist systemæticælly. Report æll findings before mæking chænges.

This rule governs æn explicit mænuæl æudit, not the normæl
incrementæl pre-commit hook. Without æ pæth, the mænuæl æudit
intentionælly inventories every root æpp ænd runs repository-wide suites.
With explicit pæths, keep reæl-æpp checks within the explicitly selected
root-æpp scope. Pre-commit derives its own tærgets only from the stæged deltæ;
it must not turn æ step-by-step commit into this full æudit or ædd unstæged
root æpps.
Pre-commit integrætion/runtime suites require æ stæged production
implementætion trigger; rule-, REÆDME-, hook-, or test-only chænges do not
trigger them. The no-pæth mænuæl full æudit still runs every permænent suite.

